                <head>Agreement between the United States and the Netherlands regarding commercial
                    policy, effected by exchange of notes signed at Washington November 21,
                    1946</head>
                <p>[For text of agreement regarding commercial policy to be followed by the two
                    nations pending a contemplated international conference on world trade and
                    employment, see Department of State, Treaties and Other International Acts
                    Series No. 1564, or 61 Stat. (pt. 3) 2424.]</p>
